  "description": "Quartz.NET 3.x scheduling for AutoRegisterDependency, targeting netstandard2.0 with Quartz 3.22. Mark a component with [Component] and [Job(Cron = \"...\")]; a single RegisterQuartzAsync() call reads every job definition, builds the JobDetail and Trigger for each, installs a container-aware IJobFactory that opens a nested lifetime scope per execution (so scoped dependencies are released per run), and starts the scheduler. Multiple cron expressions (separated by ';') produce one trigger per expression. Missing or invalid cron skips only that job with a typed error, and the scheduler is shut down with the root container. Reference either this package or AutoRegisterDependency.Extension.Quartz4, never both.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
